<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">hungering-guard</ansi> (jewelcrafting recipe)

A jeweled crossguard, cool bright metal set around a small hollow of
darkness that seems to sit a little deeper than the guard around it.
Look at it too long and the eye slides inward and stays there, caught on
something with no bottom. It was shaped to be gripped, and to grip back
-- a guard that guards nothing so much as its own appetite.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       jewelcrafting (minimum 50)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     jeweler_bench
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> Raw Gem (x2), Gold Wire (x1), Splintered Pass-Apex Claw (x1)

